# packages: what the vtest server guest installs from the snapshot that
# tests/graphics/debian-ref/image pins, one package a line: virglrenderer's
# test server, the EGL and OpenGL loaders that it opens at run time through
# libepoxy and that no package of it depends on, Mesa's llvmpipe that it
# renders on, and socat, which carries the server's local socket to TCP.
virgl-server
libegl1
libopengl0
libgl1-mesa-dri
libegl-mesa0
libgbm1
socat
